WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:34.541


2
00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:38.500
<b>Arjun has already surrendered himself</b>
<b>before Lord Sri Krishna, </b>

3
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.500
<b>and here</b>

4
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.000
<b>he continues to express his anguish further.</b>

5
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.000
<b>He says,</b>

6
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.791
<b>"All these thoughts have drowned me</b>
<b>in such profound sorrow</b>

7
00:00:46.791 --> 00:00:50.791
<b>that even my senses have ceased</b>
<b>to function properly.</b>

8
00:00:50.791 --> 00:00:52.500
<b>So deep is this grief</b>

9
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:56.208
<b>that even if I were to attain all the wealth,</b>
<b>all the kingdoms,</b>

10
00:00:56.208 --> 00:00:59.666
<b>and dominion akin to that of the gods,</b>

11
00:00:59.666 --> 00:01:02.125
<b>this sorrow would not leave me.</b>

12
00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:09.875
<b>I see no means, no person who can pull me</b>
<b>out of this situation."</b>

13
00:01:10.416 --> 00:01:14.333


14
00:01:14.333 --> 00:01:16.708
<b>Lord Krishna will undoubtedly speak,</b>

15
00:01:16.708 --> 00:01:17.791
<b>but</b>

16
00:01:17.791 --> 00:01:19.750
<b>for now, he remains silent.</b>

17
00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:25.708
<b>He has not yet responded to Arjun's surrender</b>
<b>or his sorrowful tale;</b>

18
00:01:25.708 --> 00:01:27.583
<b>he is simply listening.</b>

19
00:01:27.583 --> 00:01:28.500
<b>Meanwhile,</b>

20
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.750
<b>Arjun has become helpless.</b>

21
00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:33.208
<b>He only desires</b>

22
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:34.375
<b>that somehow,</b>

23
00:01:34.375 --> 00:01:40.083
<b>Sri Krishna shows him the way to face</b>
<b>this situation, to find a path out of it.</b>

24
00:01:40.083 --> 00:01:41.375
<b>Arjun says,</b>

25
00:01:41.375 --> 00:01:47.458
<b>"I see no other way or person</b>
<b>who can save me from this."</b>

26
00:01:47.458 --> 00:01:50.208
<b>His implication is clear:</b>

27
00:01:50.208 --> 00:01:51.333
<b>"Krishna,</b>

28
00:01:51.333 --> 00:01:52.958
<b>you are now</b>

29
00:01:52.958 --> 00:01:54.875
<b>my only support."</b>

30
00:01:54.875 --> 00:01:56.458
<b>Engulfed in worry, Arjun</b>

31
00:01:56.458 --> 00:01:58.875
<b>is trying to make it clear</b>

32
00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:01.833
<b>that this pain has now gone beyond all limits.</b>

33
00:02:01.833 --> 00:02:03.916
<b>"Please have mercy on me,</b>

34
00:02:03.916 --> 00:02:04.500
<b>Lord;</b>

35
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:08.125
<b>do not send me to anyone else for a solution."</b>

36
00:02:08.125 --> 00:02:11.708
<b>Perhaps Arjun has another doubt in his mind.</b>

37
00:02:11.708 --> 00:02:15.208
<b>What if Sri Krishna simply says, "Fight the war,</b>

38
00:02:15.208 --> 00:02:17.708
<b>and all your sorrows will vanish"?</b>

39
00:02:17.708 --> 00:02:19.291
<b>Therefore, Arjun says,</b>

40
00:02:19.291 --> 00:02:20.708
<b>"Victory in war,</b>

41
00:02:20.708 --> 00:02:21.875
<b>any kingdom,</b>

42
00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:22.833
<b>any prosperity</b>

43
00:02:22.833 --> 00:02:26.291
<b>cannot remove this sorrow from me now."</b>

44
00:02:26.291 --> 00:02:29.833
<b>From every angle, Arjun is trying</b>
<b>to convey just one thing:</b>

45
00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:32.333
<b>"I am drowning, Lord,</b>

46
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:34.625
<b>and at this moment, I need nothing else</b>

47
00:02:34.625 --> 00:02:38.291
<b>but your support and guidance."</b>

48
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:43.375


49
00:02:43.375 --> 00:02:47.958
<b>What is the definition of success?</b>

50
00:02:47.958 --> 00:02:49.166
<b>In this era,</b>

51
00:02:49.166 --> 00:02:54.291
<b>a successful person is</b>
<b>generally considered to be</b>

52
00:02:54.291 --> 00:02:57.416
<b>one who is financially prosperous,</b>

53
00:02:57.416 --> 00:02:59.916
<b>who has fame,</b>

54
00:02:59.916 --> 00:03:04.625
<b>and immense wealth.</b>

55
00:03:04.625 --> 00:03:05.583
<b>And</b>

56
00:03:05.583 --> 00:03:08.041
<b>here, Arjun says</b>

57
00:03:08.041 --> 00:03:12.416
<b>that even if he were to gain</b>
<b>all the kingdoms, all the riches,</b>

58
00:03:12.416 --> 00:03:16.916
<b>and a place akin to that of the gods,</b>

59
00:03:16.916 --> 00:03:20.625
<b>he would still not be content.</b>

60
00:03:20.625 --> 00:03:22.791
<b>Why is that?</b>

61
00:03:22.791 --> 00:03:32.208
<b>Isn't this contrary to</b>
<b>society's definition of success?</b>

62
00:03:32.208 --> 00:03:40.916
<b>Here, try to understand what success truly is.</b>

63
00:03:40.916 --> 00:03:42.208
<b>Is it wealth,</b>

64
00:03:42.208 --> 00:03:43.208
<b>fame,</b>

65
00:03:43.208 --> 00:03:44.875
<b>prosperity?</b>

66
00:03:44.875 --> 00:03:50.666
<b>Are these material comforts</b>
<b>the true measure of success?</b>

67
00:03:50.666 --> 00:03:52.125
<b>Yes,</b>

68
00:03:52.125 --> 00:03:54.166
<b>material prosperity</b>

69
00:03:54.166 --> 00:03:59.000
<b>can certainly be a part of success,</b>

70
00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:03.250
<b>it can undoubtedly assist in it,</b>

71
00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.375
<b>but</b>

72
00:04:04.375 --> 00:04:08.041
<b>in entirety, only that person is successful</b>

73
00:04:08.041 --> 00:04:10.708
<b>whose mind is content,</b>

74
00:04:10.708 --> 00:04:14.625
<b>who is satisfied from within.</b>

75
00:04:14.625 --> 00:04:19.041
<b>Arjun's mind is certainly</b>
<b>agitated at this moment,</b>

76
00:04:19.041 --> 00:04:22.291
<b>not at all content.</b>

77
00:04:22.291 --> 00:04:27.250
<b>Is your mind content,</b>

78
00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:29.458
<b>is it happy?</b>

79
00:04:29.458 --> 00:04:33.375
<b>Are you successful?</b>

80
00:04:33.375 --> 00:04:39.875
<b>Have you mistaken these material</b>
<b>comforts as your destination?  </b>

81
00:04:39.875 --> 00:04:43.208
<b>Acquire these comforts too,</b>

82
00:04:43.208 --> 00:04:44.333
<b>but</b>

83
00:04:44.333 --> 00:04:50.166
<b>understand them merely as</b>
<b>means to make your journey easier,</b>

84
00:04:50.166 --> 00:04:53.416
<b>not as the end of the journey.</b>

85
00:04:53.416 --> 00:04:55.041
<b>The end of the journey,</b>

86
00:04:55.041 --> 00:04:57.208
<b>its destination,</b>

87
00:04:57.208 --> 00:04:59.375
<b>is only peace of mind,</b>

88
00:04:59.375 --> 00:05:01.583
<b>contentment.</b>

89
00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:05.375
<b>You have to go within yourself.</b>

90
00:05:05.375 --> 00:05:10.708
<b>Physically, this journey may seem short.</b>

91
00:05:10.708 --> 00:05:11.791
<b>Yet,</b>

92
00:05:11.791 --> 00:05:14.000
<b>it is very long.</b>

93
00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.083
<b>It will take companionship.</b>

94
00:05:16.083 --> 00:05:17.875
<b>Come!</b>

95
00:05:17.875 --> 00:05:20.708
<b>Let's walk hand in hand.</b>

96
00:05:21.291 --> 00:05:25.541


97
00:05:25.541 --> 00:05:29.041
<b>In this world, everyone has some sorrow,</b>

98
00:05:29.041 --> 00:05:30.791
<b>some less,</b>

99
00:05:30.791 --> 00:05:32.708
<b>some more.</b>

100
00:05:32.708 --> 00:05:33.833
<b>But</b>

101
00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:36.166
<b>the irony is</b>

102
00:05:36.166 --> 00:05:39.833
<b>that despite everyone having sorrows,</b>

103
00:05:39.833 --> 00:05:46.291
<b>we try to show that we have none.</b>

104
00:05:46.291 --> 00:05:51.500
<b>If someone close or well-wishing asks, we say,</b>

105
00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:57.208
<b>"Everything is fine. All is well."</b>

106
00:05:57.208 --> 00:05:58.541
<b>Slowly,</b>

107
00:05:58.541 --> 00:06:04.833
<b>instead of alleviating these sorrows,</b>
<b>hiding them becomes a habit.</b>

108
00:06:04.833 --> 00:06:06.750
<b>Expressing sorrow</b>

109
00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:10.291
<b>is considered a weakness.</b>

110
00:06:10.291 --> 00:06:12.208
<b>If not to others,</b>

111
00:06:12.208 --> 00:06:21.333
<b>we often start hiding this sorrow from ourselves,</b>

112
00:06:21.333 --> 00:06:22.541
<b>and</b>

113
00:06:22.541 --> 00:06:30.833
<b>we do this by coating it with a layer of</b>
<b>material comforts and worldly successes.</b>

114
00:06:30.833 --> 00:06:33.541
<b>From the outside, everything looks shiny,</b>

115
00:06:33.541 --> 00:06:37.416
<b>everyone praises it,</b>

116
00:06:37.416 --> 00:06:41.208
<b>and this becomes like an addiction.</b>

117
00:06:41.208 --> 00:06:45.916
<b>Finding success, finding happiness</b>
<b>in others' praise.</b>

118
00:06:45.916 --> 00:06:47.166
<b>But</b>

119
00:06:47.166 --> 00:06:50.541
<b>then a time comes</b>

120
00:06:50.541 --> 00:06:57.958
<b>when the volcano of the anguished mind</b>
<b>erupts beneath this shiny layer.</b>

121
00:06:57.958 --> 00:07:00.333
<b>Then no fame,</b>

122
00:07:00.333 --> 00:07:06.000
<b>no wealth, no praise is of any use.</b>

123
00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:09.583
<b>The disease that was not treated</b>

124
00:07:09.583 --> 00:07:11.291
<b>will not go away;</b>

125
00:07:11.291 --> 00:07:20.083
<b>the sorrow that was not understood and</b>
<b>remedied will strike one day or another.</b>

126
00:07:20.083 --> 00:07:24.958
<b>You wouldn't want such a life, would you?</b>

127
00:07:24.958 --> 00:07:26.458
<b>For yourself,</b>

128
00:07:26.458 --> 00:07:30.458
<b>find solutions to keep your mind at peace.</b>

129
00:07:30.458 --> 00:07:33.125
<b>There is devotional prayer,</b>

130
00:07:33.125 --> 00:07:34.375
<b>there is meditation,</b>

131
00:07:34.375 --> 00:07:36.625
<b>there are virtuous deeds,</b>

132
00:07:36.625 --> 00:07:37.333
<b>there</b>

133
00:07:37.333 --> 00:07:40.541
<b>is this knowledge of the Bhagavad Gita.</b>

134
00:07:40.541 --> 00:07:42.250
<b>And for society,</b>

135
00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:47.125
<b>try to change the definition of success.</b>

136
00:07:47.125 --> 00:07:51.458
<b>Do not consider the expression of</b>
<b>sorrow as weakness.</b>

137
00:07:51.458 --> 00:07:53.208
<b>If someone does so,</b>

138
00:07:53.208 --> 00:07:56.250
<b>help them.</b>

139
00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.750
<b>The balm applied to others'</b>

140
00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:02.583
<b>wounds also heals many of your own.</b>

141
00:08:03.166 --> 00:08:07.791


142
00:08:07.791 --> 00:08:11.750
<b>Arjun is forgetting his life's purpose,</b>

143
00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:15.541
<b>which is why he has gone astray.</b>

144
00:08:15.541 --> 00:08:18.458
<b>What is the purpose of your life?</b>

145
00:08:18.458 --> 00:08:23.458
<b>What is the purpose of your institution,</b>
<b>your organization?</b>

146
00:08:23.458 --> 00:08:25.916
<b>Whether they are business enterprises</b>

147
00:08:25.916 --> 00:08:27.166
<b>or people,</b>

148
00:08:27.166 --> 00:08:35.083
<b>society is slowly understanding the inclination</b>
<b>towards a purposeful life and its importance.</b>

149
00:08:35.083 --> 00:08:38.583
<b>Purpose is like that ray of the sun that</b>

150
00:08:38.583 --> 00:08:43.625
<b>circulates new energy within you.</b>

151
00:08:43.625 --> 00:08:48.333
<b>Businesses that run aimlessly,</b>
<b>solely chasing profits,</b>

152
00:08:48.333 --> 00:08:49.750
<b>such people,</b>

153
00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:52.666
<b>generally get tired,</b>

154
00:08:52.666 --> 00:08:57.708
<b>and the enthusiasm to continuously</b>
<b>move forward slowly diminishes.</b>

155
00:08:57.708 --> 00:09:01.041
<b>One part of the purpose is personal,</b>

156
00:09:01.041 --> 00:09:03.458
<b>what you want,</b>

157
00:09:03.458 --> 00:09:06.000
<b>and another </b>

158
00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:07.458
<b>big part is</b>

159
00:09:07.458 --> 00:09:10.750
<b>human welfare,</b>

160
00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:14.416
<b>what you are giving to this society,</b>

161
00:09:14.416 --> 00:09:19.500
<b>how you are positively impacting</b>
<b>the lives of others.</b>

162
00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:25.250
<b>Try to find your purpose,</b>
<b>your organization's purpose;</b>

163
00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:29.208
<b>this guiding star will surely</b>
<b>be found in the sky of life,</b>

164
00:09:29.208 --> 00:09:31.875
<b>and once found,</b>

165
00:09:31.875 --> 00:09:35.375
<b>hold onto its path and keep moving.</b>

